EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

We attempted to reach you earlier today and yesterday regarding a returned payment. This is our second attempt to reach you regarding the returned ACH. We have not heard back, therefore payment will be automatically reran tomorrow. Please note, if additional payments are returned and we have not heard from you the account may move into automatic default due to non-payment.

Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
